update cpl_memory set summary = 'Answers q-exhibit-universe-grows-with-stamps-s661: no rename keeps an old key. A MAP title with no entry joins the reference already stamped when a CER procedure classifies it. Backlog titles an audit caught were outside the universe; Nov 14''s 133 arrived and were stamped between audits (new work and settlement at once). With the backlog counted, remaining fell 3,618 (Oct 27) to 3,030 (Nov 15).'
